      "hints": [
        "Begin with what happens when the emitted microwave reaches the metal sheet.",
        "Then describe how the incident and reflected waves combine and what distinguishes nodes from antinodes."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "The microwave emitted by the device reflects from the metal sheet.",
        "The reflected wave overlaps and superposes with the incident wave travelling in the opposite direction.",
        "Their superposition creates a stationary wave with fixed positions of maximum and minimum resultant amplitude.",
        "At antinodes the resultant amplitude is maximum; at nodes it is minimum or zero."
      ],
