        "In a vacuum, microwave speed is c = 3.0 \u00d7 10\u2078 m s\u207b\u00b9.",
        "Use \u03bb = c / f = (3.0 \u00d7 10\u2078) / (6.3 \u00d7 10\u2079).",
        "The wavelength is 0.048 m."
